# CLAUDE.md — Claude Code working notes

Persistent context for **{{SYSTEM_NAME}} screen creation + live prototyping**. **Read `CONTEXT.md` first**
— it has the full bootstrap (scope gate, project facts, skill table, critical rules). This file
adds Claude-Code-specific workflow notes + the current working state, and is loaded automatically
by Claude Code on startup.

## Scope (one line)
This context **consumes** the published {{SYSTEM_NAME}} library to build **consumer screens** (Figma file
`{{CONSUMER_FIGMA_KEY}}`) + **coded prototypes** (`prototypes/`). The design system itself —
tokens/components/variants, publish, drift — lives in the separate **`{{DS_REPO}}`**.
A {{SYSTEM_NAME}} gap found while building routes **back** there; never hand-build a {{SYSTEM_NAME}} equivalent here.

